      "mergeID": "601469fd2db68e7f65579783",
      "mergedPostDetails": "As pointed out in the initial (completed) canny, the haptics that we can use right now are so weak (around 10% of what is possible) that they are barely noticeable by the player. We should have access to a reasonable haptics power, if not the full amount of what is possible.\nSee https://vrchat.canny.io/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/expose-vrcplayerapiplayhapticeventinhand-for-udon",
      "mergedPostTitle": "PlayHapticEventInHand Amplitute is way too weak",
